---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy & Affiliate Disclosure" 
  description="Privacy Policy, data processing guidelines, and Amazon Affiliate disclosure for PowerStation Hub US."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy & Affiliate Transparency</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Amazon Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          PowerStationHub.com is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for website owners to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you click on links to various merchants on this site and make a purchase, this can result in this site earning a commission. Affiliate links are marked with sponsored attributes (<code class="bg-slate-900 px-2 py-1 rounded text-orange-400">rel="nofollow sponsored"</code>).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Information Collection & Usage</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We prioritize user privacy. We do not collect personally identifiable information (PII) unless voluntarily submitted by you via contact forms. standard web server analytics (such as IP addresses, browser types, referring pages) are collected strictly for performance optimization and traffic analysis.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Affiliate partners, including Amazon.com, may use cookies to track orders generated through our outbound affiliate links. These cookies enable Amazon to attribute qualifying sales to our partner account.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or affiliate practices, please contact us at support@powerstationhub.com.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
